check 1
# Level generation of the Den of Evil (level 8): ScnAma, -seed 1234, idle
# in town until frame 20, then the level warp (poke `warp 8`, tile 0) on
# both sides (poke.md warp; the call form also measured from a waypoint
# warp, facts/calls/warp-0x53aec0.jsonl). Compare rooms, presets and the
# populated units from the arrival on, and the draws (rng_poke.py). Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name a1-warp-den-ama
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 160
seconds 900
channels state rng
at 20 poke warp 8
